olimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nThe derivative of the inverse hyperbolic sine function is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arsinh x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=-3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=-3\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166597 #edb/ref 1069 "e-8346" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166597 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{\\ln{\\pi}}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\,\\textrm d x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166597 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "43e9b2da-1e6d-52b5-9312-c07d2d7a682b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166597 #edb/ref 1074 "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nThe derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosine function is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arcosh x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\pi }{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\pi \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\pi \\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166598 #edb/ref 1069 "e-8347" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166598 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nCalculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{1}{2(1-x^2)}\\,\\textrm d x$ for $|x|< 1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166598 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "528e7b19-3de0-5c93-8b7f-82383486eafc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166598 #edb/ref 1074 "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nThe derivative of the inverse hyperbolic tangent function is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\artanh x) = \\dfrac{1}{1-x^2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{2(1-{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049314 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186167338 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186167394 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360608 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360609 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360610 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360611 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186519524 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1039 "Integrating Using Arcsinh" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186166596 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166758 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "f360178a-5c2b-56d5-b12d-622e1aedf6ef" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186167339 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186167395 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360612 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360613 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360614 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360615 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360616 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186360617 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186519602 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1039 "Integrating Using Arcosh" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186166597 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166759 #edb/r